helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145066				0	pt-BR	Retorna o logaritmo natural de um número.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159414				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe:				20200411 15:09:53
