helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	pt-BR	Parâmetros:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	pt-BR	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> qualquer expressão numérica para a qual você deseje calcular a tangente (em radianos).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153728				0	pt-BR	Para converter graus em radianos, multiplique por Pi/180. Para converter radianos em graus, multiplique por 180/Pi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3155414				0	pt-BR	graus=(radian*180)/Pi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	pt-BR	radian=(graus*Pi)/180				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	pt-BR	Pi é aproximadamente 3,141593.				20200411 15:09:53
