helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154016				0	pt-BR	Print "o comprimento do lado adjacente do ângulo é"; (d1 / tan (dAlpha * Pi / 180))				20200411 15:09:53
