helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	pt-BR	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	pt-BR	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog to change toolbars, menus and other user interface items.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071				0	pt-BR	Você pode alterar os itens na barra de menus. Você pode excluir itens, adicionar novos itens, copiar itens entre os menus, renomear itens e assim por diante.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	pt-BR	As barras de ferramentas podem ser livremente configuradas.				20200411 15:09:53
