helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\version_number.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	pt-BR	Choose \<emph\>Help - About $[officename]\</emph\>. This opens a dialog containing information about the program, like the version and build number.				20200411 15:09:53
