helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN104A0				0	pt-BR	\<image id=\"img_id3149646\" src=\"starmath/res/al21826.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.25inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149646\"\>Ícone\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
