helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3155623				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=INVLOG(0,05;0;1)\</item\> retorna 0,19.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	bm_id3158417				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função DIST.LOGNORMAL\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>distribuição acumulada\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
