helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3146963				0	pt-BR	No Windows: FAR PASCAL (_far _pascal)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3153809				0	pt-BR	Outros: padrão (padrão específico do sistema operacional)				20200411 15:09:53
