helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156399	221			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=BASE(17;10;4)\</item\> retorna 0017 no sistema decimal.				20200411 15:09:53
