helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154635	19			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MOEDA(367.456;2)\</item\> retorna $367,46. Utilize o separador decimal que corresponde a \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"current locale setting\"\>definição da locale atual\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
