helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148626	200			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=REPT("Bom dia";2)\</item\> retorna Bom diaBom dia.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149805				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função DIREITA\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
