helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3158440	40			0	pt-BR	Retorna \<emph\>Número\</emph\>\<emph\>!!\</emph\>, a fatorial dupla de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, onde \<emph\>Número\</emph\> é um inteiro maior ou igual a zero.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2480849				0	pt-BR	Para números pares FATDUPLO(n) retorna:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	pt-BR	2*4*6*8* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2927335				0	pt-BR	Para números ímpares FATDUPLO(n) retorna:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	pt-BR	1*3*5*7* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	pt-BR	FATDUPLO(0) retorna 1 por definição.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154622				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id7844477				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FATDUPLO(5)\</item\> retorna 15.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116	43			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FATDUPLO(6)\</item\> retorna 48.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id6478469				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FATDUPLO(0)\</item\> retorna 1.				20200411 15:09:53
