helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3146148				0	pt-BR	Se A=VERDADEIRO e B=FALSO, os seguintes exemplos serão exibidos:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3083285	44			0	pt-BR	           \<item type=\"input\"\>=AND(A;B)\</item\> returns FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3083444	45			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=OU(A;B)\</item\> retorna VERDADEIRO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154314	46			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NÃO(E(A;B))\</item\> retorna VERDADEIRO				20200411 15:09:53
