helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154842	8			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FALSO()\</item\> retorna FALSO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3147468	9			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NÃO(FALSO())\</item\> retorna VERDADEIRO				20200411 15:09:53
