helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147372				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3157996				0	pt-BR	NÃO(ValorLógico)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148766	16			0	pt-BR	            \<emph\>ValorLógico\</emph\> é qualquer valor a ser complementado.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149884				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150132	18			0	pt-BR	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=NÃO(A)\</item\>. Se A=VERDADEIRO então NÃO(A) será FALSO.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função OU\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394				0	pt-BR	OU				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>Retornará VERDADEIRO se pelo menos um argumento for VERDADEIRO.\</ahelp\> Essa função retornará o valor FALSO se todos os argumentos tiverem o valor lógico FALSO.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	pt-BR	Os argumentos podem ser expressões lógicas (VERDADEIRO, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10), que retornam valores lógicos, ou matrizes (A1:C3) contendo valores lógicos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3153546				0	pt-BR	Quando uma função espera um único valor e você insere um intervalo de células, o valor do intervalo é obtido da mesma coluna ou linha da fórmula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027				0	pt-BR	Se o intervalo inserido estiver fora da coluna ou da linha atual da fórmula, a função retornará o valor de erro #VALOR!				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468				0	pt-BR	OU(ValorLógico1; ValorLógico2 ...ValorLógico30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819	24			0	pt-BR	\<emph\>ValorLógico1; ValorLógico2 ...ValorLógico30\</emph\> são condições a serem verificadas. Todas as condições podem ser ou VERDADEIRO ou FALSO. Se um intervalo for inserido como parâmetro, a função utiliza o valor no intervalo que estiver na linha ou coluna atual.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228				0	pt-BR	Examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154870				0	pt-BR	Os valores lógicos das entradas 12<11; 13>22, e 45=45 devem ser verificados.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371	27			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=OU(12<11;13>22;45=45)\</item\> retorna VERDADEIRO.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412	59			0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=OU(FALSO;VERDADEIRO)\</item\> retorna VERDADEIRO.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394K				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>XOR function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394K				0	pt-BR	XOR				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060K				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>Returns the exclusive "or" of arguments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771K				0	pt-BR	The arguments are either numbers, logical expressions themselves (TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10) that return logical values, or arrays (A1:C3).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027K				0	pt-BR	If the entered range is outside of the current column or row of the formula, the function returns the error value #VALUE!				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517K				0	pt-BR	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468K				0	pt-BR	XOR(Value1; Value2 ...Value30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819K				0	pt-BR	\<emph\>Value1; Value2 ...Value30\</emph\> are added modulo 2. TRUE is returned if the result of this addition is 1;FALSE is returned if the result of this addition is 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228K				0	pt-BR	Examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371K				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(12<11;13>22;10)\</item\> returns TRUE since this converts to (1+0+10) mod 2 = 0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412K				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(FALSE;TRUE)\</item\> returns TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	tit				0	pt-BR	Funções matemáticas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147124				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>funções matemáticas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Assistente de funções; matemáticas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>funções; funções matemáticas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>funções trigonométricas\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147124				0	pt-BR	Funções matemáticas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154943				0	pt-BR	\<variable id=\"mathematiktext\"\>Essa categoria contém as funções \<emph\>matemáticas\</emph\> do Calc. \</variable\> Para abrir o \<emph\>Assistente de funções\</emph\>, escolha \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"Inserir - Função\"\>\<emph\>Inserir - Função\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146944				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ABS\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>valores absolutos\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>valores;absolutos\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146944				0	pt-BR	ABS				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154546				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ABS\"\>Retorna o valor absoluto de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154843				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147475				0	pt-BR	ABS(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148438				0	pt-BR	\<emph\>Número\</emph\> é o valor cujo valor absoluto será calculado. O valor absoluto de um número é seu valor sem o sinal de + ou -.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155823				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152787				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(-56)\</item\> retorna 56.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148752				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(12)\</item\> retorna 12.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id320139				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(0)\</item\> retorna 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150896				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função CONTAR.VAZIO\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>contar;células vazias\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>células vazias;contar\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150896				0	pt-BR	CONTAR.VAZIO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155260				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ANZAHLLEEREZELLEN\"\>Retorna o número de células vazias.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145144				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3153931				0	pt-BR	CONTAR.VAZIO(Intervalo)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149512				0	pt-BR	 Retorna o número de células vazias no intervalo \<emph\>Intervalo\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146139				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148586				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CONTAR.VAZIO(A1:B2)\</item\> retorna 4 se as células A1, A2, B1, e B2 forem todas vazias.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153114				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ACOS\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153114				0	pt-BR	ACOS				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3145163				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCCOS\"\>Retorna o arco-cosseno (inverso do cosseno trigonométrico) de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153565				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150020				0	pt-BR	ACOS(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159134				0	pt-BR	 Essa função retorna o cosseno trigonométrico inverso (arco cosseno) de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, isto é, o ângulo (em radianos) cujo cosseno é Número. O ângulo retornado está entre 0 e PI.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id679647				0	pt-BR	Para obter o ângulo em graus, use a função GRAUS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149882				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150128				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOS(-1)\</item\> retorna 3,14159265358979 (PI radianos)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8792382				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GRAUS(ACOS(0,5))\</item\> retorna 60. O cosseno de 60 graus é 0,5.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145355				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ACOSH\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145355				0	pt-BR	ACOSH				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3157993				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCOSHYP\"\>Retorna o cosseno hiperbólico inverso (arco cosseno hiperbólico) de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145295				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151017				0	pt-BR	ACOSH(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149000	64			0	pt-BR	 Essa função retorna o cosseno hiperbólico inverso (arco cosseno hiperbólico) de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, isto é, o número cujo cosseno hiperbólico é Número. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6393932				0	pt-BR	 Número deve ser maior ou igual a 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150566				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3145629				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOSH(1)\</item\> retorna 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id951567				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOSH(COSH(4))\</item\> retorna 4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149027				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ACOT\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149027				0	pt-BR	ACOT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155818				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCCOT\"\>Retorna a cotangente inversa (arco-cotangente) do número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153225				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158419				0	pt-BR	ACOT(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	pt-BR	Essa função retorna a cotangente trigonométrica inversa (arco cotangente) de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, isto é, o ângulo (em radianos) cuja cotangente é Número. O ângulo retornado será entre 0 e PI.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5834528				0	pt-BR	Para obter o ângulo em graus, utilize a função GRAUS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147538				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155375				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOT(1)\</item\> retorna 0,785398163397448 (PI/4 radianos).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8589434				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GRAUS(ACOT(1))\</item\> retorna 45. A cotangente de 45 graus é 1. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148426				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ACOTH\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148426				0	pt-BR	ACOTH				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147478				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCOTHYP\"\>Retorna a cotangente hiperbólica inversa (arco cotangente hiperbólica) do número dado.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152585				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147172				0	pt-BR	ACOTH(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3146155				0	pt-BR	 Essa função retorna a cotangente hiperbólica inversa (arco-cotangente hiperbólica) de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, isto é, o número cuja cotangente hiperbólica é Número.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5818659				0	pt-BR	Ocorrerá um erro caso Número estiver entre -1 e +1 inclusive.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083452				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150608				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOTH(1,1)\</item\> retorna a cotangente hiperbólica inversa (arco cotangente hiperbólica) de 1,1, aproximadamente 1,52226.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145084				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ASEN\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145084				0	pt-BR	ASEN				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156296				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCSIN\"\>Retorna o seno trigonométrico inverso (arco seno) de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149716				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156305				0	pt-BR	ASEN(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	pt-BR	 Essa função retorna o seno trigonométrico inverso (arco seno trigonométrico) de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, isto é, o ângulo (em radianos) cujo seno é Número. O ângulo retornado está entre -PI/2 e +PI/2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id203863				0	pt-BR	Para obter o ângulo em graus, use a função GRAUS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149448				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156100				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ASEN(0)\</item\> retorna 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6853846				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ASEN(1)\</item\> retorna 1,5707963267949 (PI/2 radianos). 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8772240				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GRAUS(ASEN(0,5))\</item\> retorna 30. O seno de 30 graus é 0,5.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151266				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ASENH\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151266				0	pt-BR	ASENH				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147077				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARSINHYP\"\>Retorna o seno hiperbólico inverso (arco-seno hiperbólico) de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150763				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150882				0	pt-BR	ASENH(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147621	104			0	pt-BR	 Essa função retorna seno hiperbólico inverso (arco seno hiperbólico) de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, isto é, o número cujo seno hiperbólico é Número. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153212				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156120				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ASENH(-90)\</item\> retorna aproximadamente -5,1929877.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id4808496				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ASENH(SENH(4))\</item\> retorna 4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155996				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ATAN\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155996				0	pt-BR	ATAN				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149985				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCTAN\"\>Retorna a tangente trigonométrica inversa (arco tangente) de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151294				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150261				0	pt-BR	ATAN(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147267				0	pt-BR	 Essa função retorna a tangente trigonométrica inversa (arco-tangente) de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, isto é, o ângulo (em radianos) cuja tangente é Número. O ângulo retornado está entre -PI/2 e PI/2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6293527				0	pt-BR	Para obter o ângulo em graus, use a função GRAUS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154054				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143229				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ATAN(1)\</item\> retorna 0,785398163397448 (PI/4 radianos).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8746299				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GRAUS(ATAN(1))\</item\> retorna 45. A tangente de 45 graus é 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153983				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função ATAN2\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153983				0	pt-BR	ATAN2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154297				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCTAN2\"\>Retorna a tangente trigonométrica inversa (arco tangente) das coordenadas x e y especificadas.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149758				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156013				0	pt-BR	ATAN2(NúmeroX; NúmeroY)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151168				0	pt-BR	\<emph\>NúmeroX\</emph\> é o valor da coordenada x.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152798				0	pt-BR	\<emph\>NúmeroY\</emph\> é o valor da coordenada y.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5036164				0	pt-BR	ATAN2 retorna a tangente trigonométrica inversa (arco tangente), isto é, o ângulo (em radianos) entre o eixo x e uma linha do ponto NúmeroX, NúmeroY até a origem. O ângulo retornado está entre -PI e +PI.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3001800				0	pt-BR	Para obter o ângulo em graus, utilize a função GRAUS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145663				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154692				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ATAN2(20;20)\</item\> retorna 0,785398163397448 (PI/4 radianos).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1477095				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GRAUS(ATAN2(12,3;12,3))\</item\> retorna 45. A tangente de 45 graus é 1.				20200411 15:09:53
