helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3153350	231			0	pt-BR	 Retorna \<emph\>Número\</emph\> arredondado para o próximo inteiro par, para cima. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155508				0	pt-BR	Exemplos				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154361				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PAR(2.3)\</item\> retorna 4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8477736				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PAR(2)\</item\> retorna 2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id159611				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ÉPAR(0)\</item\> retorna 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6097598				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PAR(-0,5)\</item\> retorna -2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147356				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função MDC\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>máximo divisor comum\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147356				0	pt-BR	MDC				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152465				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GGT\"\>Retorna o maior divisor comum de dois ou mais inteiros.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id2769249				0	pt-BR	O máximo divisor comum é o maior inteiro positivo que dividirá, sem restos, cada um dos inteiros fornecidos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150643				0	pt-BR	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154524				0	pt-BR	MDC(Inteiro1; Inteiro2; ...; Inteiro30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149340				0	pt-BR	\<emph\>Inteiro1 a 30\</emph\> são até 30 inteiros cujo maior divisor comum será calculado.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147317				0	pt-BR	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151285				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MDC(16;32;24) \</item\>retorna 8, por que 8 é o maior número que pode dividir 16, 24 e 32 sem deixar resto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1604663				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MDC(B1:B3)\</item\> onde as células B1, B2, B3 contém \<item type=\"input\"\>9\</item\>, \<item type=\"input\"\>12\</item\>, \<item type=\"input\"\>9\</item\> retorna 3.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151221				0	pt-BR	\<bookmark_value\>função MDC_ADD\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
