helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152301				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TAN(PI()/4) \</item\>retorna 1, a tangente de PI/4 radianos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1804864				0	pt-BR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TAN(RADIANOS(45))\</item\> retorna 1, a tangente de 45 graus.				20200411 15:09:53
