helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159269				0	pt-BR	BDMULTIPL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152879				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBPRODUKT\"\>BDMULTIPL multiplica todas as células de um intervalo de dados cujo conteúdo corresponda aos critérios de pesquisa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
