helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149789				0	pt-BR	Escolha \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Inserir – Quadro\</item\> e clique em \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150224				0	pt-BR	Insira texto no quadro e, se desejar, redimensione-o.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150242				0	pt-BR	Escolha \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatar - Quadro/Objeto\</item\>, e clique na guia \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Opções\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
