helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_date_conv.xhp	0	help	par_id3155527				0	pt-BR	Escolha \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferências\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ferramentas - Opções\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Tabela\</item\>, e marque ou desmarque a caixa \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Number recognition\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_date_conv.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	pt-BR	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferências\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ferramentas - Opções\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040500.xhp\" name=\"Document de texto - Tabela\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Tabela\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
