helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3156108				0	pt-BR	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Styles\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066				0	pt-BR	Na lista, clique com o botão direito do mouse no estilo de página para o qual você deseja especificar a fonte de papel e, em seguida, escolha \<emph\>Modificar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	pt-BR	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paper tray\</item\> box, select the paper tray that you want to use.				20200411 15:09:53
