helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150939				0	pt-BR	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select the page style that you want to apply to the page that follows the manual break.				20200411 15:09:53
