helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3150527	19			0	pt-BR	Select a caption title from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Category\</item\> box, and select a numbering style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> box. \<br/\>You also can enter a caption text in this dialog. If you want, enter text in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Caption\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3153166				0	pt-BR	Clique em \<emph\>Opções\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3153190				0	pt-BR	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Level\</item\> box, select the number of heading levels to include in the chapter number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3155553				0	pt-BR	Type the character that you want to separate the chapter number(s) from the caption number in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Separator\</item\> box, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3155586				0	pt-BR	Na caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Legenda\</emph\>, clique em \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226				0	pt-BR	O $[officename] pode adicionar automaticamente um a legenda ao inserir um objeto, figura ou tabela. Selecione \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferências\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ferramentas - Opções\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Legenda automática\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
