helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	pt-BR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FLD_FUNC_LB_LISTITEMS\"\>Lista os itens. O item superior é mostrado no documento.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
